---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 14,
  title: 'Day 14',
  date: '2026-09-19',
  description: 'fourteenth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          Today, I wake up as planned, and as I planned I started reading book I
          don't remember title but I wasn't reading it for 30min as I wanted, I
          couldn't focus for that long that early, I was reading for about
          10mins, I also re-downloaded course at my iPad, I thought i sent it
          wrong but file I sent was broken, so I just needed to get correct
          version and send that one. I also went to the work and Today I just
          wanted to rest so, I decided to listen something easier and more
          interesting like Witcher elf bood, and I think I needed that for
          recovery mental abilities.I also watched Next.js course while I was
          going to work, unfortunately without laptop so I still need to create
          a project page
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        'll read book after wake up for at least 10min, after, that I'll create
        Next.js project page, and I'll write what I learned at Next.js page I
        also creating + I need to go to sleep earlier than usual to change my
        sleep cycle, because I was working at night, and from now I'm working at
        days
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll gave 6/10, I watched Next.js course, I started a new habits and I
          rest my mind a bit, by listening Witcher at work, I like the way that
          day looks
        </p>
      </div>
      <DayRating class="w-full" rating={6} />
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
